---
layout: base.njk
---

<section class="works-section" id="selected-works">
  <div class="works-grid">
    {% for work in collections.selectedWorks %}
      {% include "work-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2>About</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-text">
      <p>Hi! :–)</p>
      <p>
        I'm Gunnhildur, a graphic designer from Iceland, currently based in
        Reykjavík. My work spans visual identities, books, exhibitions and
        print, with an interest in thoughtful concepts and considered visual
        communication.
      </p>
      <p>
        I hold a Master’s degree in Strategic Design and Entrepreneurship from
        the Royal Danish Academy and Copenhagen Business School (2025), and a
        Bachelor’s degree in Visual Communication from the Iceland University
        of the Arts (2021).
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm available for selected freelance collaborations in visual identity,
        graphic design and print. For enquiries or just to say hello, feel free
        to get in touch.
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="about-image">
      <img src="{{ '/images/profile.png' | url }}" alt="Portrait of {{ site.name }}" loading="lazy">
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact-section" id="contact">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
  </div>

  <a class="big-link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
</section>
